sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You (or an orchestrator agent)
    participant RJ as run-job
    participant RT as run-task
    participant Q as Quota observers
    participant W as Worker CLI
    participant G as Git / GitHub
    participant L as Ledger + alerts
    U->>RJ: run-job --repo R --task-file task.md
    RJ->>G: lock repo, git worktree add -b router/<slug>-<stamp>
    RJ->>RT: run-task in the worktree
    RT->>Q: fresh cache, else one isolated live read (hard timeout)
    Q-->>RT: meters (unknown / stale = ineligible)
    alt no eligible worker or meter >= 85% (full size)
        RT-->>U: refused, nothing run
    end
    RT->>W: headless run, prompt via stdin or 0600 file, block shims on PATH
    alt failed, quota error, timeout or stall
        RT->>W: kill process group, fail over once
    end
    RT->>RT: restore protected files, redact logs, leak check
    RT->>L: ledger row
    RJ->>RJ: run tests, retry once with the failure tail
    RJ->>G: re-scan staged files, commit on the router branch only
    RJ->>L: job record + alert if failed or leak-blocked
    U->>RJ: review <job>  (diff, tests, leak check, screenshots)
    U->>G: approve --action push --sha <head>
    RJ->>G: push (never force) + draft PR, ci --watch
    U->>G: approve --action merge --sha <head>
    RJ->>G: merge only if PR head == approved SHA and required checks are green
